* `compensatedMinor_le_twisted_block` — combining it with the twisted relative
  bound gives the assembled `α²`-carrying budget

      𝒟(α) ≤ 8Λ²α²·s²·(∑ w(α))²ℓ²,

  in which the localization gain is carried by the log-block length `ℓ` and the
  constant contains no exponential in `α`.
